Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 13:29:46 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 05/17] qt: add OmarchyTheme, a live reader for the Omarchy
 desktop theme

Qt-only class that parses the flat colors.toml of the active Omarchy theme with
per-key fallbacks and a built-in dark palette, derives a background ramp and a
WCAG contrast clamp, and watches the file and its ancestor directories (re-armed
after every change, debounced) because Omarchy replaces files and directories
when the theme is switched. Covered by test_qt_omarchytheme.
